        "qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors",
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] A live-action contemporary Chinese drama on the riverfront basketball court in <Picture 1> just after rain. A single continuous eye-level medium two-shot holds both faces and shoulders in focus, the woman in the dark teal canvas jacket on the left (S1) and the man in the rust-brown jacket with an orange basketball held low at his hip on the right (S2). The court lamp, backboard, riverside railing and skyline remain in the same positions. Even blue dusk and the warm court lamp light the two naturally. At about two seconds the woman looks directly at him and asks softly: <d>[Chinese] 明天还来吗？</d> She waits and listens. He keeps the ball steady at his hip, meets her gaze and around five seconds answers with quiet resolve: <d>[Chinese] 来。球我带。</d> Her mouth settles into a small, relieved smile. Both breathe naturally as the conversation falls quiet. A gentle steady breeze moves loose strands of hair. The camera remains on the same eye-level composition for the whole ten seconds.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft outdoor court ambience with a faint distant traffic wash. A light cloth rustle during the pause. Two distinct natural Mandarin voices in turn, then a little open-air room tone.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
